      "side": 1,
      "message": "PP1800_S0 and PP3300_S0 has to be staged with Pp1800_S0 ramp up first since it is used by RK3399 as staging / intermediate rail for 3.3V GPIOs. Power off typicaly would be in reverse order as Shawn is doing. But I am double checking with Rockchip .",
