      "writtenOn": "2016-08-18T23:36:05Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Just got confirmation from Rockchip / TSMC guidance with regard of impact on GPIO ( since PP3300_S0 is powering GPIO pads where Pp1800_S0 is the intermediate rail for those same pads). The guideline is that if we can ensue that PP3300_S0 and PP1800_S0 are powering down in same slew rate , then we can turn of fthem at the same time. Otherwise, it is safer and recommended to turn off PP3300_S0 before turning off PP1800_S0 .",
